# Quests: generated by tools/quests/make_quests.py, edit there
betterquesting.questline.7dZOq4U1Vfa2Yr9apUvsiQ.name=Better Communications
betterquesting.questline.7dZOq4U1Vfa2Yr9apUvsiQ.desc=Telephones on pylon lines, radios, mobile phones and satellites, carried by voice chat.
betterquesting.quest.IHTr1EMRVx6vQQ7722eirw.name=Wired for Sound
betterquesting.quest.IHTr1EMRVx6vQQ7722eirw.desc=Everything starts with a wire. Phone Cable is red alloy wire in rubber, made in the assembler. It joins a Telephone to a Line Terminal, up to 32 blocks of it, and loses nothing on the way.
betterquesting.quest.b14IecXxXxuWU8oeGOPcNw.name=Ring, Ring
betterquesting.quest.b14IecXxXxuWU8oeGOPcNw.desc=A Telephone: a circuit, a note block for the bell and a steel body, assembled with a cord of Phone Cable. Right-click it to pick up the handset. It's yours, and its six-digit number is too.
betterquesting.quest.mXRjCMiFWsyGTG0Id2bbig.name=End of the Line
betterquesting.quest.mXRjCMiFWsyGTG0Id2bbig.desc=Every line starts and ends at a Line Terminal. It runs on 4 EU/t of LV power, serves exactly one phone on its cable, and links to one Pylon Head: wrench the terminal, then the head.
betterquesting.quest._OpArmItVHW8jB5_z18yig.name=Up on the Pole
betterquesting.quest._OpArmItVHW8jB5_z18yig.desc=A Pylon Head on top of a column of 6 to 16 Steel Frame Boxes carries the line. Two pylons link up to four times the shorter one's height apart, as long as nothing solid is in the way. Pylons need no power and keep working unloaded. The line loses signal with every block: plan a repeater at least every 225 blocks.
betterquesting.quest._xekW5q3V6-D2yESxW4Bqw.name=Hello? Can You Hear Me?
betterquesting.quest._xekW5q3V6-D2yESxW4Bqw.desc=Two Telephones, each on its own Line Terminal, and pylons between them. Pick up the handset: with only one other phone on the line it rings straight away, otherwise dial a number or pick a contact. Make a call that connects. A Telephone call is narrow and gritty, but it carries your voice as far as the line goes.
betterquesting.quest.EwUn7B5YXiqaZtu5vTGc2Q.name=Keeping the Signal Alive
betterquesting.quest.EwUn7B5YXiqaZtu5vTGc2Q.desc=A Repeater Head is a Pylon Head that regenerates the signal, so line loss starts over after it. It takes 4 EU/t of LV power from a cable on any side, and works only while loaded and powered.
betterquesting.quest.ARn2PctkVOe0cqI7997r1Q.name=Switchboard
betterquesting.quest.ARn2PctkVOe0cqI7997r1Q.desc=A plain line joins exactly two phones. A Router Head has 15 link slots and turns lines into a network, where any phone can dial any other. It regenerates the signal like a repeater, and takes 16 EU/t of LV power from a cable.
# End of quests

